{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03806","headline":"咏日 · 董思恭","name":"咏日","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"沧海十枝晖，悬圃重轮庆。\n蕣华发晨楹，菱彩飜朝镜。\n忽遇惊风飘，自有浮云映。\n更也人皆仰，无待挥戈正。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"董思恭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03806.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03806","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}